<title>LEBANON: Lebanon budget deficit 774 bln pounds in October.</title>
<headline>Lebanon budget deficit 774 bln pounds in October.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's budget deficit for October soared to 774 billion Lebanese pounds from 486 billion in September, the finance ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Interest payments were 740 billion pounds in October from 286 billion in September.</p>
<p>The ministry issued the following details (in billions of Lebanese pounds):</p>
<p>					    Oct 96	     Sep 96</p>
<p>Expenditures			    1,061		 778</p>
<p>(of which Interest payments)	  740		 286</p>
<p>Revenues				    287		 292</p>
<p>Deficit				     774		 486</p>
<p>($1=1,556 at end October)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
